ecific finding (\"31 standing findings that are product decisions... rather than a lint fix\") nearly verbatim instead of citing the ADR number.","lens":"VIOLATION","sites":["bin/gauntlet:199"],"released":true},{"finding":"**Cite, don't restate** — same rule. This test-file comment restates the `probeStop` mechanism (\"a hook is reached with its payload on stdin, and the same path as a plain command exits 0 having checked nothing\") already carried in `check-contract.ts`'s docstring and ADR-0087, rather than naming the ADR.","lens":"VIOLATION","sites":[".Workflow/agent-workflows/shared/check-contract.test.ts:99"],"released":true},{"finding":"**Cite, don't restate** — same rule. This test comment restates ADR-0087's specific mechanism and measured numbers (\"Claude Code hands a hook its payload on stdin... 255 turn-end runs reported `clean`\") instead of citing the ADR.","lens":"VIOLATION","sites":[".Workflow/agent-workflows/shared/generate-contract.test.ts:87"],"released":true}]
